axis(1, labels = format(seq(from = start, to = start +
length(temp)/te...@samp.rate, by = "15 s"), "%H:%M:%S"), at =
seq(0,length(temp)/te...@samp.rate, by = 15))

length(temp) gives you the no. samples
te...@samp.rate gives you the sample rate
Therefore length(temp)/te...@samp.rate gives you the length of the
song in seconds.

This would be slightly different using the ggplot2 spectro function,
but I haven't had the chance to explore that one yet (but I'm looking
forward to it!).

Steffi

